  <acceptance-criteria>
    <criterion testable="true">tsc -p in src/dataverse/forms/sprk_matter reports zero errors and insightCardMount.js matches its compiled output.</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">Neither insightCardMount nor matter_insight_card_host.html still renders the InsightSummaryCard placeholder.</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">A pull request against master is open, ready for review, with the item ids in its body.</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">Negative: the PR contains no package-lock.json changes and no file outside this task's scope.</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">The after-change test run has no failure that is absent from the master baseline run.</criterion>
  </acceptance-criteria>

  <completion date="2026-10-03">PR #1116 (c2c10cc01). Found that the insightCardMount.js extracted from 1c56cd29b did NOT equal the tsc output of its .ts: task 080 hand-edited the .js, and the pre-commit hook ran prettier on the .ts only (lint-staged does not cover .js). Regenerated the .js with tsc -p; a second compile diffs to zero. Line-ending-only rewrites of two sibling .js files were discarded.</completion>
  <notes>Does not build the missing @spaarke/ai-widgets browser bundle; no bundler config exists for it, so that would be new infrastructure, not cleanup.</notes>

